ed. All stages use locally shaded surface porewaters or pools under anoxic conditions, avoiding an assumed vent-to-surface transfer. Moving between alkaline assembly and acidic hydrolysis stages requires quantified acid inventories, dilution, volatile losses, and organic recovery; purification is not assumed. Abundant Fe2+ can sequester cyanide and sulfide and must be included in experimental material balances. Neutral formulas are bookkeeping representations, not claims about solution speciation. No enantioselection is predicted. The evidence supplied does not justify a high-confidence complete prebiotic synthesis.\n\nMOLECULES (27 nodes):\n  - mol_001: C2H2O2 (Glyoxal) [starting]\n  - mol_002: C2H4O2 (Glycolaldehyde) [starting]\n  - mol_003: NH3 (Ammonia) [starting]\n  - mol_004: CH2O (Formaldehyde) [starting]\n  - mol_005: CHN (Hydrogen cyanide) [starting]\n  - mol_006: H2O (Water) [starting]\n  - mol_007: H2S (Hydrogen sulfide) [starting]\n  - mol_008: CH2O2 (Formic acid) [starting]\n  - mol_009: C2H3N (Methyl isocyanide) [starting]\n  - mol_010: C4H6O4 (2,3-Dihydroxybutane-1,4-dial) [intermediate]\n  - mol_011: C4H4O3 (2-Oxobutane-1,4-dial) [hub_intermediate]\n  - mol_012: C5H6N2O (Imidazoleacetaldehyde) [intermediate]\n  - mol_013: C5H7N3 (Imidazoleacetaldehyde imine) [hub_intermediate]\n  - mol_014: C6H8N4 (Histidinenitrile) [hub_intermediate]\n  - mol_015: C4H5NO2 (4-Imino-2-oxobutanal) [hub_intermediate]\n  - mol_016: C5H6N2O2 (2-Amino-4,5-dioxopentanenitrile) [intermediate]\n  - mol_017: C6H10N4O (Histidinamide) [hub_intermediate]\n  - mol_018: C6H10N4S (Histidinethioamide) [hub_intermediate]\n  - mol_019: C6H9N3OS (Histidine thioacid, C(=O)SH form) [intermediate]\n  - mol_020: C6H9N3O2 (DL-Histidine) [target]\n  - mol_021: C8H12N4O2 (N-Formylhistidine N-methylamide) [hub_intermediate]\n  - mol_022: C7H10N2O4 (2-Formamido-N-methyl-4,5-dioxopentanamide) [intermediate]\n  - mol_023: C7H12N4O (Histidine N-methylamide) [intermediate]\n  - mol_024: C2H4O2 (Acet